    description: "The producer resolves webPreferences.preload only when the value is a literal path off __dirname that names an analysed file (path.join / path.resolve / join / resolve of string segments, __dirname + '/x', a template literal). electron-vite and tsc layouts name build output (join(__dirname, '../preload/index.js') from src/main; path.resolve(__dirname, '..', 'dist', ...)), so they resolve to nothing. A preload file that calls contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld is still found by the other producer form. Repro: electron/ fixtures in the evidence directory.\n\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/jilik/ (RESULTS.md, sweep/). Found while building WI-jilik (entry-kind PR, 2026-11-21)."  # 7432
